  "title": "Coast Guard rescues surfer beset by weather off Bolivar Beach, Texas",
  "description": "A Coast Guard MH-65 Dolphin helicopter crew from Air Station Houston hoists a 20-year-old swimmer in distress off Bolivar Beach, Texas, April 29, 2023. Coast Guard Sector Houston-Galveston watchstanders received a relayed 911 call at 3:50 p.m. stating the surfer was being pushed offshore in 8-foot seas and winds of 34 mph, and that his father was also struggling while swimming out to help him. (U.S. Coast Guard video, courtesy Air Station Houston)",
